lines:
Yeah! I’ve waited so long for this!
Pokémon Contests!{be00}
I’m going to enter!{be01}
But before I do, I have to catch some
Pokémon!

Whew... I’m just bushed...{be01}
I hiked over from Mauville City.
But, boy, this city’s huge.{be01}
If I’d known this, I would’ve ridden
my Bike here.

Do you know the TM Secret Power?{be01}
Our group, we love the TM
Secret Power.{be01}
One of our members will give it to you.
Come back and show me if you get it.{be01}
We’ll accept you as a member and sell
you good stuff in secrecy.

Fufufu...
Capt. Stern, I presume.{be01}
We of Team Aqua will assume
control of your submarine!{be01}
Your objections are meaningless!
We expect your total cooperation!{be01}
Fufufu...
Just watch and learn what Team{be00}
Aqua has planned!
